Arrays: Boxes that can hold multiple values unlike variables that can hold only single value at a time
         If we have group of something with similar data type - Store them as Array

STATIC ARRAY:
12, 34, 56, 78, 93

int a = 12;
int b =34;
int c= 56;
int d = 78;
int e = 93;



56

dataType variableName = value;

