12, 34, 56, 78, 93

1. dataType[] arrayName = {value1, value2, value3, value4.......} // we use this when we know the exact values we want to store
2. dataType[] arrayName = new dataTYpe[countOfValuesWeWantToStore]; // we use this syntax if i don't know exact values that i want to store

